# An allow list: the build context holds nothing but what the image needs.
# Keys (.env), data, video, clips, caches and git history never reach the daemon or the image.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!data_labels/

# inside the allowed folders
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.env
**/*.env
**/*.mp4
**/*.wav
